"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These Turkish-program options trade a lower points quote in reported economy for reported business class and a shorter overall journey. For either, award support for one traveler and taxes/fees are unconfirmed, and the award price scope is unknown. Both also depend on a separate SFO–LAX ticket; repositioning permission and the consequences of separate tickets are unconfirmed, and the positioning-fare scopes are unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Reported economy, fewer points\",\"v\":\"At 110,000 Turkish-program points, this is the lower points quote of the two.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Reported business, shorter trip\",\"v\":\"The reported business cabin may suit a cabin preference; the journey is 84 minutes shorter overall and arrives 4 hours 35 minutes earlier than the economy option.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash reference\",\"v\":\"For the plain SFO–BKK cash itinerary, the quoted fare is USD 452.00; its price scope is unknown.\"}]}"
